WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.229 --> 00:00:02.940
- (crowd cheering) She is
featured on this month's

00:00:02.940 --> 00:00:04.500
cover of Health magazine,

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.530
and it's the first unretouched cover

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:08.320
in the magazine's
history. (crowd cheering)

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:09.727
So let's talk about your part there.

00:00:09.727 --> 00:00:11.040
I mean is it hard?

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:12.980
Because everything nowadays is so filtered

00:00:12.980 --> 00:00:13.813
and so retouched.

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:14.650
Was it hard and scary,

00:00:14.650 --> 00:00:16.460
especially six months after having a baby?

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:18.220
- It was so scary.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.960
And leading up I was still breastfeeding

00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:21.150
when I did the shoot.

00:00:21.150 --> 00:00:23.539
And I was just freaking
out the whole time.

00:00:23.539 --> 00:00:24.830
- And that part was probably good,

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:25.680
'cause they're real full. (laughs)

00:00:25.680 --> 00:00:27.493
- Oh, I didn't need the help.

00:00:28.404 --> 00:00:30.701
- Some of us do Kate. (both laughing)

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:34.600
- Something like, I
didn't need any extra, no.

00:00:34.600 --> 00:00:35.480
But you know?

00:00:35.480 --> 00:00:38.010
Unretouched is actually
really part for everybody

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.710
on set I noticed like, the makeup artist,

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.187
the hairstylist, everyone's like,

00:00:42.187 --> 00:00:44.067
"Oh my God, what are we
gonna do with her bruise

00:00:44.067 --> 00:00:45.067
"on her knee?

00:00:45.067 --> 00:00:46.337
"Who's gonna cover it?

00:00:46.337 --> 00:00:47.630
"The makeup is not covering it!"

00:00:47.630 --> 00:00:48.940
Everything's very stressful.

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:51.060
And doing it in natural lighting,

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:53.860
adds that very real element as well.

00:00:53.860 --> 00:00:57.370
- Boy, natural lighting is not
my friend. (crowd laughing)

00:00:57.370 --> 00:00:58.403
I like it nice soft amber dim light.

00:00:58.403 --> 00:01:02.090
- [Kate] That's such a
lie, stop! (laughing)

00:01:02.090 --> 00:01:04.540
No, but it was really
important for me to do this.

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.380
Because we're on Instagram all the time,

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:09.770
and we see people
Photoshopping everything.

00:01:09.770 --> 00:01:11.442
You know like, when does it end?

00:01:11.442 --> 00:01:13.311
When you're scrolling on Instagram,

00:01:13.311 --> 00:01:16.570
you constantly compare
yourself to these other people.

00:01:16.570 --> 00:01:18.642
And for me, I wanted us
to like take a set back

00:01:18.642 --> 00:01:21.343
and show a real moment of
someone who actually is

00:01:21.343 --> 00:01:24.162
a six months post-partum,
is not being Photoshop.

00:01:24.162 --> 00:01:27.362
And be that real person and real influence

00:01:27.362 --> 00:01:28.281
for other people.
- I love it!

00:01:28.281 --> 00:01:31.809
I think it's awesome. (clapping)

